#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Launch/Using-Substitutions.rst:23
msgid ""
"Launch files are used to start nodes, services and execute processes. This "
"set of actions may have arguments, which affect their behavior. "
"Substitutions can be used in arguments to provide more flexibility when "
"describing reusable launch files. Substitutions are variables that are only "
"evaluated during execution of the launch description and can be used to "
"acquire specific information like a launch configuration, an environment "
"variable, or to evaluate an arbitrary Python expression."
msgstr ""

